# King T'Challa // Black Panther, Hope Enduring is a modal double-faced card (CR 712.3): its back face has a mana cost of
# its own, {4}{W}{U}, and flash, so Bot1 casts it as that face (CR 712.11b) in Bot2's turn, and it is put onto the
# battlefield back face up (CR 712.8f). Bot2 bolts it: "Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Black Panther" is a
# static ability's prevention effect (CR 615.1, 604.1), so the 3 damage is never dealt (CR 615.6) and the 3/3 lives with
# no damage marked; the history records the prevention, by Black Panther's own effect. Without the prevention the Bolt
# would kill it (black-panther-dies-to-damage-that-cant-be-prevented).

